https://github.com/devemio/docker-color-output

`di`: Alias for docker images, showing Docker images with colored output.

`dps`: Alias for docker ps, listing running containers with colored output.

`dcps`: Alias for docker compose ps, showing Docker Compose services with colored output.

The `"$@"` passes any additional arguments you provide to the original command.

